values ('a1b2c3d4-5e6f-4a53-8d23-3e4f5a6b7c93', 'art-history-i-ancient-to-medieval', 'Art History I (Ancient to Medieval)', 'Art History I introduces visual and material culture from prehistory through the medieval period, with sustained attention to method, object study, chronology, religion, empire, ritual, architecture, manuscripts, craft, exchange, museums, and cultural heritage ethics. The course is global in ambition while preserving the Fine Arts survey sequence expected of an ancient-to-medieval art history core.');

